{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1257,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47afa2db2bd9c45619b4733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要证明我的胜利方程式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "828813ed39987b7eb5c3e2478d4f8b18810f248a0ddf329d4350a05c3c54b163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb5fd4a0d4b6308f57862608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プライベートも\r\n有意義に過ごしたいものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11661afded8ee46070595d734d0ee37b17ffe09ad2dfda767cf25fd54bc3ce5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5fb8106ab2f4e8c0019f0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服は『大人っぽく見える』らしい。\r\n誉め言葉と受け取っておこう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b410033cdb01f48e032151a6ea6dc5f6efe7ca66a793fb1ced3cd62b098eed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a58b23745ee6c55b21e79e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロボット工学の叡智か…\r\n着ていると身が引き締まるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0706e8d0babbd14e229c0eba34adea2bf0c709ebf820ef77571e6c2971bdbbaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49528ee682d4133a200eeb43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命令を、マスター。…なんて、\r\nつい言いたくなるな、この服は。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54b0d90a2d5d1a227ae2873a9044e5fabb897123d2d323c292549fbe424805a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b84154a369f94c404e3f2945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服便是学生的证明。\r\n仔细打理是不可或缺的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04fbb14ebc16ab2673f492ceb758c1f00eae116f99c7b6fddc66086a31cfb29b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369aa680ab1d035bcba5c62a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live和比赛都一样，\r\n需要不断钻研以面对挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9fa765aabc326f0c72e9ab8dff29b80e0a11e865f30c896db5ead35cc2eee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bacee5d4c3bd4168ec3fb2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服令人印象深刻，\r\n很不错吧？刚开始……\r\n我有点害羞就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a06817ab31a193c2d066f1d16e1a15e2600f219723ffa70a1d7e43ac38777e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75eeb8f0c559c732610ed573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我来说果然太可爱了。\r\n……虽然我很中意啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc8ddc0765ca43d548a8216f4247c444739526ca75c245aad4f59ef8660d2d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67feef68fa0e7e6f9c6b45e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧身的舞台服装，\r\n也可以当作体态管理的指标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e450bbe0bcafae70a924141a907196946006f55115c3d472dea5bc8007d2e977",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4fad66493dbf98167b3ae29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上这套决胜服──\r\n我会建构起胜利的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4b8b0e3dffdadea631d8f3c3f089c82124978196fe59964a4575abae6031a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db4503ed27ed1a34f1ea3b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "きらびやかで優美なシルエットだろう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bf894b351c14cf0ed3594bfd5bf4922c272d28f062922abb8cf4b301a156f74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:169bd40dcdb717a9b021d4ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆に夢を与える存在に、なれているだろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21638037fed18123939b8f598592450ecbc48cf35e02e3e8e8882cc5a8b7e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c4555d2259a71779615d8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b54539d912762dea6da6f5e6fafe79020ecf89c9e8a57ebc14fc472038336bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56dcf7baa7523d7eae96182b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要证明我的胜利方程式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "828813ed39987b7eb5c3e2478d4f8b18810f248a0ddf329d4350a05c3c54b163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e493f0b485d4a3de68926657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロボット工学の叡智か…\r\n着ていると身が引き締まるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0706e8d0babbd14e229c0eba34adea2bf0c709ebf820ef77571e6c2971bdbbaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38d38f50b0c6de0aef3f03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "命令を、マスター。…なんて、\r\nつい言いたくなるな、この服は。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54b0d90a2d5d1a227ae2873a9044e5fabb897123d2d323c292549fbe424805a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7a01484dbcc26fdda80761c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21871737fbdf2e25224afb0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先来试个水温……\r\n让我来测试你的力量吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5d9682f19731aea8dc143e2bdf573f50d175105cf4b55e0d84cf4b05595100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0886fab3bbc3213f80c050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我了解你的实力了。\r\n那么你应该能解开这个方程式吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "09185f799c6e820c7d727d98c246efcf31666256498fa9c7877b21b16c9a5ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca4de93dbc4a48bdd106dd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我推荐你早餐吃蔬菜满满的\r\n三明治。花点心思做些变化，\r\n就每天都吃不腻了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a00a36b048a2cff2dc4b0860d1c11491b63b6e47744c9279ba2f140d7e6743c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5545a82d6d1e684126fa16a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能否有效运用早晨的时间，\r\n会给一天的综合成果带来莫大影响。\r\n……这样很严肃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b958cdea21a5712565f64a3b1e3713fb2246c387ad67ffc5cf110b7e5002fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:738ca5619a83a1aa54f9c274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的个子算高，所以换位子时\r\n大多会选择坐在后面。\r\n……绝对不是因为头发的关系哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca18159cbe2f32e6a0ddf80cdf0f8dbba3b7ad49f30661e55398153fdded620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98286fdec4ac316aae49fe49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休我经常会到图书馆去。找书也是\r\n一个理由，不过能在安静的环境中\r\n专注下来，真的十分舒畅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e27c9b41a3aa3eb43cdcb26469e7a69ea6e34ab80c4dcf8f92e707f2afa99ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d55755bb33ae219956f4760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，你困不困？\r\n……之前奖券说，\r\n和我聊天常常会想睡觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9a388935f2dde4ca79fadba1246fa1f72515e7ea9da33b3b701e17818cd60f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5846790405b57256c1a0e148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "探究理论是不分昼夜的……\r\n要在避免过度熬夜的同时，\r\n在结束一天之前尽力做到最好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d30e239580b7eca213cb4603f73cd1946062a25d86294d1f474e9b7fbc488cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8627d2be639b1bfa271b32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期的新生很抢眼。\r\n她们青涩的动作和表情一看就知道。\r\n……或许我以前也是那副模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d63d1e2f31291d1863053082c04306b248bcad7cb6ae4e1071f0a1c022f3185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3693fb8edc43b0cc83031b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……这也无可奈何，\r\n不过夏天特别会囤积热气在头发里。\r\n我得注意保养，以免伤到发质……",
      "source_fingerprint": "311efc6f46c92b0d88793ece31c228f66f7053f175f7148f7f88f0dd145052a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c64ddc2ea3bfd40c9d6a63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有许多气候舒适的日子，\r\n可望提升训练的效率。\r\n我们就来安排特别强化项目吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b768e7fd85e364ee43af200eb63185a9aa285ee6e57ad3d25a6d19328102e976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4104423022e51859d28cb6a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变冷了啊，训练员君。\r\n不嫌弃的话，我请你喝一碗\r\n能有效温暖身子的特制汤品吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7676a6368a271c6b5c66000546da024048ce174f94a272d2f4bd03ab5060da30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c4ed08e468d65232491c1c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。希望今天对你来说，\r\n也是充满幸福喜悦的一天……\r\n说说而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb442b05463ef4a07abebc23054aab92c08f79f48522a98bb15b3ed6b2f55055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a1071204e6fe0ed74da84e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……穿上这身打扮时，\r\n都要早起。因为需要花时间\r\n确认装饰是不是全都戴上了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7af0452c488f631584a6a59405839578a8c18f3721abae767a9b8999132f8bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a79c176e306fe8acb12638ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "茶点就用奶油圆蛋糕和德式圣诞面包\r\n怎么样？不只美味，\r\n还很适合用来补充能量喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c214ec7a8e7a22008a1f7f0a84e8676ebcac8e62bde71a7ff1cb7093cecbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec14ae072524de641eb91dac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，打起精神来吧。\r\n只要当个乖孩子，\r\n或许会有意想不到的好运临门喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "923cf30c997c19710f1065764677b3e457e4bf7bb16db763cef203dc8d6f5198",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250fb86874c2bcf132e9c9b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在带有凉意的夜晚，我推荐\r\n肉桂叶的香气。可以带着\r\n放松温暖的感觉慢慢睡着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b60b59596517cbe772439e00be9385885616893d43b5dab36670a04e74b07b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd9db73d0fb64a496d54250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把驯鹿的影片传给大进好了。\r\n……希望她受到疗愈后，\r\n可以稍微睡好一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab96135f9c2938553897aa1f9f72d835112df37132a230732fbeecc3d49d6e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f35d6657ef2ec85efd80ed09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到白色三叶草，我就会想起从前喔。\r\n……想起妹妹曾经做来送我的\r\n可爱花冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1230959a918dc9a3b4cc6dfaf6220afcba7e59c39303330927d39292219ff43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8abe9828be4b99e276c04373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「食用雪人」是类似「食用辣油」的概念吗？\r\n附近的咖啡厅好像有这样的东西……\r\n真令人好奇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3745066b3136f137b1e01855e39c38fad7d3966a51e12321e9479bbb41dd7e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d03da591767fd17d6062900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变凉了呢……对了，\r\n你要不要也穿上毛皮看看？\r\n我觉得应该会很适合喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96449e9dea38f922616b97d7fcc8647cdd504276bc66feb4879a53ca690b1fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9b8dd1145aa2fe6dcfdec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要一下雪，奖券就会到处奔跑，\r\n大进则会缩成一团……说实在的，\r\n她们两人的心情我都懂喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "506c19fa12114328d26eb64054dd5a4180879a836c9f5a1ef839c228e1316df2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0952363bd1ebb6d53a54745",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5bf5d9f4aa4e5eaa629040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48ed80fe0dd30b78a02e1319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脈拍・血圧・睡眠時間、全て正常…\r\nいい1日の始まりだ。試験でも\r\nレースでも、相応の活躍をしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b47937d95a45ebe898a66074eb3a4c22087ab3416099065bf430e090205745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f6e0a209722fb4d7a3dba37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝も、オペラオー君の演劇に\r\n巻き込まれてね。役を演じるうちに\r\n目が覚めてくる。おすすめだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ec53cd4c8a4494c9921c9eb62eb605638a9269054cb20b1bef964d8044ece2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea60657aeacc0ac55fdff858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼食の折、ロイス君からファンサの\r\n講義を受けてね。あの見事な分析…\r\n食事を忘れて聞き入ってしまったな",
      "source_fingerprint": "f762a7fc01c8aafca88ee5722a0234be3e239e3ede4f3d3d1940910f88e1cbf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95972671a162b0c6620474d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放課後、図書室でメサイア君によく\r\n会う。いつも気になる本を読んで\r\nいてね…つい積読が増えてしまうよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "101ca223e0be6a706a77d492f591967864d8ecd78b633f5ca72031ff41b4611e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30df9e4c1f5a84227a8f530b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜間の外出は極力避けたい。\r\nこの服は、全体的に発光するゆえ…\r\nその…注目を集めすぎてな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e745d1c110b7dbe79b9827c134d71c10984abffa8c545de38f3fe435ae1dae39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cfc577dded103244cd0cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブライアン、風呂上がりの髪を\r\n放置する習慣は変わっていないか…\r\n今夜は一緒に髪を乾かすとするか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6ca437764491ee63bacfa8758231538d00fce65e20e3ab61e412c2de48fa60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b81bc3c74abf93924ed2c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入学記念に買った今の関数電卓…\r\nこいつとどれだけの難問を解いて\r\nきたか。まだ買い替える気はないよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c636ead4275c26e9df5c6c812b0f4a27747ebec6a89d5fac295bc382fbf7d6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e87611a854d7b7681b8ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服の冷却装置で真夏も快適さ。\r\nひんやりする、とチケットが\r\nくっついてくるほどだ…ふふ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0827a274068ee97efc79d01a6124ddce6ed3cd6e90fad54b5b6e035cbe12ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d998e8b78152a996ad119160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "矢の角度や的までの距離…弓道は、\r\n分析次第で的中率を上げられる。\r\n運動の秋だし、久々にやろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8963099f40eab4193af9bfc20de61137778cc2bf821e7143a95b715216f41d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfbe6be3492d862c8c2b837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甘酒は冬バテ対策に優れている。\r\n小さい頃、母がよく作ってくれてね\r\n…不思議と心まで温かくなるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8173419c81979b7c18b0008313fcaa9072ab711b3f8ce67d0b75777da9fdd43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877b2b93b40a899cea0da78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6a6c5408e87de0cd17be68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管书有多厚，\r\n大进一定都会把它看完。不过……\r\n她的感想很随便就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0290d3f61713c61b07ec7fbc1b736823a1a5fb5d733fe61ca7f7f43124212e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6609b651bff24c91b0e96844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天奖券拜托我教她功课……\r\n不要紧，理论上应该能……\r\n回避掉考不及格的危机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed56f4873afd929e85a2d570212be2cac20d83e5049157b5c3795daa43cc4eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2c07a926ec4f573996c386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的推理剧很优秀。像是\r\n值得考察的伏笔，还有人际关系……\r\n害我洗完澡之后不小心看入迷了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7738370e8bc13c1965ff134ba094fea78c05e6329f019a4e4e3835a11d2316f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f42849a104cc55284e3569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这阵子房里有毛毛虫出没……\r\n鼓起一身毛扭动的模样……\r\n啊啊，光是回想起来就毛骨悚然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd338ca6e2c9b16d93a75ccf78268da08b639242ced7e250883de13ca16d195e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c042a5dd3ee081ff5e2804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈来跟我抱怨\r\n白仁都联系不上。\r\n真是……当姐姐真辛苦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e548e700a7d4de589c668fbbab0a0a9d84cccbfdf5e82bd8253c4c0e455a3bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc4d85e196884f9e8580849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛状况我大致可以预料，\r\n可是舞台的不确定要素太多了。\r\n所以我才会紧张吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae8ea2c955c66b52aa9142b919eb5750e8e1b5ee75827c1669d3d69ba57649a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68c7c969ae6d85295768ee9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我应该算是不太会唱歌跳舞那种人。\r\n不过……只要有人希望我登台，\r\n我就会努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ce20858337fe379d7c7a0dddca0bd534dd7e9da3c75d1a174bd3774f23ea14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0ffdf1104a7c0a7c6ea706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们比赛时的模样，\r\n就该深深烙印在观众记忆里……\r\n这个款式的震撼性应该无可挑剔吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0833168e5934be215a76e3f7c1e760b3e4b49b77c4e1e5e50dae381638a79d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83ddd117580c9a6b24e8ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服展现了我的决心。\r\n总有一天，我一定要完成\r\n自己的「方程式」……赢得一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1219f8d9623ec2a4061401958af9de40cad6f19193098e35030adc0ed8c8ac01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c868627a5a6e94855b73367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的例行计划一旦被打乱，\r\n我会一整天都坐立难安。\r\n所以我会花时间调整自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa94a459b76d048a88c4060fa6df2fd45997f64145a742363831a56009af0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9af5e8107a636dc6d39f75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有效活用下午时段，\r\n午餐应该吃八分饱就好。\r\n……除非遇到爱吃的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37bc011285db38dc50d8a6e1049105b61e8dcd2fc50fcf1900bf28cb87f91170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbbd86e18584c6336168555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まずは小手調べ…。\r\n君の力量を測らせてもらおう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a694b4b72414818c06349a988769212d8cc1cb799be81be195ce98f4b28293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f1eee7d0ced76e0a8bb6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在就寝时能够立刻入睡吗？\r\n自省已经成了我的习惯……\r\n如果有办法赶快睡着，拜托你告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22093849ce6894020a6a35b66d208cb1092acac3343c6ea8fe88fa9754fb983c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4163c813ac105ccc948619cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢春天。毕竟花开得很灿烂。\r\n而且在跑步时发现花朵，\r\n还会带来表现变好的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b0447323334d323f220c0d6351d2d79238320b0110ce978584b071759f1f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36b3c7aecbe00dae5b14ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "营养均衡的饮食\r\n能有效防止中暑……\r\n不过白仁她就是挑食呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc254e3c08dd88cc6e5fe7fc5578eec25a37e59d2dacaaca3f68ee917a29774a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d225f4f2e4b32e146593557",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的夜晚很适合看书。\r\n虽然类型各有不同，\r\n不过我会替你挑选几部推荐书刊的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b1a3a381afbf5b93a8dff16e894d1172d26d2c3321f37cdd13297064d8d922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:408e51ebd068eacf7bbfb7a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "攻击与回避的精密交锋……！\r\n我和奖券及大进交手过了，\r\n打雪仗还挺好玩的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b32add150eb25982db456a2af5cd8d20af6512855aab6de9ba431daceac25a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753f60f03ced598558cc98e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前曾陪妹妹一起做过姜饼人。\r\n我陪她重做了非常非常多次，\r\n直到她能顺利画好脸为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccc7164e27c05dcaca9b23e76383747952654920fb88c61a74666f79b7f0baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f505507b87628497bf43caf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「有个胡子乱糟糟的圣诞老人」\r\n好像流传着这样的传闻……\r\n不过我的头发……可没有乱糟糟的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a556262afbb6f553815dede5e2f71f353ec6de39ddb6a7c6e14118fcd7414b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ebbeec833cf65f534bf561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我见到了素质。\r\n莫名地很有亲近感喔。\r\n……或许是颜色的关系吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2cacd89f3bbc812ccd2d734d7a80bbd8b4ed1e7e531bd8423d9a7af3987211b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e003bbe844a435264db5c8a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮跟我说她想穿这套服装。\r\n……我听了虽然开心，\r\n但也担心会不会滑下来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb42b7821a08af8bacd54064bfcc3836e09297ad9b1b32149aa67ecb52d19cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba76f0b2e5ddbe660b157cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家拿了星星又拿了胡子过来……\r\n到底是想要圣诞树还是圣诞老人，\r\n至少统一一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db14088f7d7107f1fd0fa7f0c4d095b17f1027a02fa909319969b9bcf9f9b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d485c684bc30f93c80d0a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道如果像以前一样\r\n在袜子里放糖果，\r\n白仁会露出什么样的表情……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3f1bdcd33cc50c185109f7063fb9e70f503c6944a75a7e2c604c9f62a3ff80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a10d21410348f2aba34e56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在打扫时间带着白色袋子，\r\n学妹们看到都眼睛一亮……\r\n……我该随身带着礼物才对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c324846db00aebfeaa12cd6b935b79fbcbb187dc50df3e00fc129d2eb0a00ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b972a1ebe99cc13a8f2f68d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔在外面吃个饭怎么样？\r\n找餐厅的事就交给我吧。\r\n我最擅长找出行家才知道的店了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76995425f2ff2261343ed71818ea9b6150f1b8a8109240c287faa685522dd78f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3846f628acb05649e83b43a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪花融化，进入了灿烂的季节……\r\n虽然松了口气，\r\n但又莫名有种落寞的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e88bec39869e3ad285687abb271af31668e1bed4d36055c9a9b08a3a4308080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b04f43ec9cec12b7b3fa994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有点……不对，是相当炎热呢。\r\n暂时在冷气下面凉快一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "640bb0e36f16124873fd755826cf6a52b42c41951307d8949246148d3ab0009e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91025"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
